    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu, umwami Nebukadineza w’i Babiloni atera igihugu c’i Buyuda, Yehoyakimu amubera umusavyi kumara imyaka itatu. Ariko inyuma yaho agarariza Nebukadineza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " aca arungika Abanyababiloni, Abaramu, Abanyamowabu, Abamoni n’Abasiriya, batera Ubuyuda. Barabusambura nk’uko Ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ryari ryabivuze riciye ku basavyi biwe ari bo bavugishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koko ivyo vyashikiye Ubuyuda nk’uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yabitegetse, kugira ngo abirukane mu maso hiwe, ku bw’ivyaha vyose Manase yakoze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "harimwo gusesa amaraso y’abantu ata co bazira, ayo yatembesheje nk’inzuzi i Yerusalemu, bituma ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yanka kuvyihanganira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’Abayuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yehoyakimu ahamvya ba sekuruza, maze Yehoyakini umuhungu wiwe aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami wa Egiputa ntiyabaye agisubira kuva mu gihugu ciwe, kuko umwami wa Babiloni yari yafashe igihugu cose ahereye ku kagezi ka Egiputa ugashisa ku ruzi Efurate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini yari afise imyaka cumi n’umunani igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aganza amezi atatu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Nehushita mwene Elunatani w’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se yakoze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ngoma ya Yehoyakini, abakuru n’ingabo za Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni baraza bugariza igisagara ca Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni ubwiwe arishikira mu gisagara mu gihe bari bacugarije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini umwami w’i Buyuda, nyina wiwe, abasavyi biwe, abatware hamwe n’abubahwa biwe bose barishikana kuri Nebukadineza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira umunani umwami w’i Babiloni ari ku ngoma, atwara Yehoyakini nk’imbohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarabivuze, Nebukadineza atwara ubutunzi bwose bwari mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " no mu kirimba c’umwami, atwara ibikoresho vyari bicuzwe mu nzahabu Salomo umwami wa Isirayeli yari yarakoresheje akabishira mu Ngoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atwara mu buja ababa i Yerusalemu bose: abatware, abasoda, abacuzi, abanyamyuga, bose hamwe bari ibihumbi cumi. Abakene bo muri ico gihugu ni bo bonyene basigaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza afata Yehoyakini, amutwara nk’imbohe i Babiloni, atwara na nyina w’umwami, abagore b’umwami, abatware biwe hamwe n’abakuru bo muri ico gihugu bose, abakuye i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami wa Babiloni yongera atwara abasoda ibihumbi indwi, bakomeye cane, bamenyereye intambara, hamwe n’abacuzi n’abanyamyuga igihumbi b’abahinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yimika Mataniya sewabo wa Yehoyakini nk’umwami, ahindura izina ryiwe amwita Zedekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekiya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’umwe igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Hamutali mwene Yeremiya w’i Libuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko Yehoyakimu yakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo vyose vyashikiye Yerusalemu n’Ubuyuda kubera uburake bw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bwari bwaziririnze, akirukana abantu biwe mu maso hiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Zedekiya agarariza umwami w’i Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
